WEBVTT

00:06:53.996 --> 00:07:02.829
because it seems like. Humility is
also at the center of what allows

00:07:02.829 --> 00:07:08.496
for someone to. Pursue a
truth or information or

00:07:08.496 --> 00:07:10.288
a point of view that might not be theirs,

00:07:10.788 --> 00:07:15.329
but I think so many of us take
a more defensive posture

00:07:15.329 --> 00:07:17.496
and our are more closed off

00:07:17.496 --> 00:07:19.746
and declarative about things
that we think we know.

00:07:19.746 --> 00:07:24.038
And I just wanted to ask you kind of
what role you feel humility plays

00:07:24.038 --> 00:07:31.038
and why it might not be such a given that
the actual value of it is the truth